This repository uses the external private workflow from `szymoniwacz/ai-project-template`.

Project-specific context is stored in `.ai/`.

Use `bin/ai-workflow-doctor` to validate the integration and `bin/ai-workflow` as the adapter entrypoint.

Do not copy, recreate, or approximate reusable workflow behavior in this repository when the private workflow is unavailable.
